          "description": "Welcome to “Ey Up Ellis!” The kids podcast where 8-year-old Ellis from Leeds chats with his dad and some very special guests about life, music, sport (especially football and Leeds United), books, games, science, fascinating animal facts and more…\n\nJoin us for heartwarming and hilarious conversations filled with Ellis’ unique curiosity and perspective. With fun features, jokes and fascinating facts, this podcast is perfect for kids, families, football fans, animal lovers and anyone who loves a good natter. \n\nTune in and subscribe for a delightful mix of education and entertainment!",
          "author": "Ellis Wiffen, Simon Wiffen",
